<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on SBC.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on SBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Bank Corp, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    325.00 CHF		PREMIUM	16.02 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.45 CHF		  GEARING	17.10 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.APR.97-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	07.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  295.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
